# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Not a style preference: the Mermaid build bundled with Nextra does not treat
# a lone CR as a line terminator, so a diagram in a CRLF working copy fails to
# parse with "Expecting NEWLINE, got SPACE" and renders as an error box. It
# builds and deploys correctly from CI, where the checkout is LF — which makes
# it a bug only Windows contributors ever see, and only locally.
#
# `adawy-platform`, `jumeira` and `aladawy-pack` carry the same file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
